Description: uFldNodeComms: bound how many nodes may be tracked
 Unique NODE_REPORT identities trigger quadratic uFldNodeComms work
 .
 24.8.1's FldNodeComms keeps its node records in m_map_record rather than a ContactLedger, so the bound counts that map.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/moos-ivp/moos-ivp/commit/3f0928a9712f802d020414e190ed21a1a028d34b
Applied-Upstream: https://github.com/moos-ivp/moos-ivp/commit/3f0928a9712f802d020414e190ed21a1a028d34b
Bug: https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-85446
Last-Update: 2026-11-13
---
